    {
      "text": "Figure 11, 'Proof of Vaccination scenario: Online Status Check (National DDCC:VS) use case (UC006)'. The Figure 8 workflow with one path highlighted: presentation (1), receipt (2), cryptographic verification required, status checking application (3), online check performed by the national PHA against its DDCC registry service (4), no international check, results communicated back to the verifier (6), Point C. The international PHA step is greyed out.",
